#, no-wrap
msgid "Display Link"
msgstr ""

#. type: #display-link
#: ../src/factory-controller.adoc:27
msgid ""
"Display links can be attached to a factory controller block to display "
"information about this factory controller. See the in-game ponder for the "
"usage of display links."
msgstr ""

#. type: Block title
#: ../src/factory-controller.adoc:28
#, no-wrap
msgid "Display boards displaying information about a factory controller"
msgstr ""

#. type: #display-link
#: ../src/factory-controller.adoc:31
msgid ""
"Each line of the display represents the status of a factory gauge inside the "
"factory controller. Only factory gauges configured to xref:factory-"
"gauge.adoc#basic-production[produce] an item are included."
msgstr ""
